// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - MysticStory 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1453499993" "The mystic's story"
// DetailString :
"P2413866354" "One of the Circle mages you defeated said: <br><br>'The Tome of Tormvodel? I know of it. It's secrets are useless to us, but if you truly sought to restore a ghost to it's body, perhaps it could work. We've recently recovered a copy from a seller in the Nerva Archipelago. But if you value your life and soul, you'd never be fool enough to try and take it from us!'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Tome 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1361572362" "Tome of Tormvodel"
// DetailString :
"P2177501115" "This ancient tome, stolen from Oranbega, should provide the clues Ghost Widow needs to restore her mortal form."

