"P3540175701" "You never disappoint, {VillainName}. I knew I could turn to you for results. Now, we must acquire this Tome of Tormvodel. I trust you will be your usual capable self."
// RandomFameString :
"P1423251250" "The Circle is on the lookout for {VillainName}!"

