"P1380177572" "You switched the crystals"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission5_Part3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2318007523" "Return crystal to Daos"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2010596332" "Are you done with Arbiter Daos's errand yet?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3940771503" "My Lord Recluse will be glad to have this. And that gratitude will almost be enough to spare your life, despite your part in all of this. Do one more thing, and not only will you be forgiven your trespasses, but you may well be rewarded. When Ghost Widow attempts to restore her life, you are to use that moment to strike her down once more. Her soul will resume it's ghostly un-life, and once more be bound to Arachnos. <br><br>The Red Widow was one of Lord Recluse's most trusted assistants. It was she who assassinated the original leader of Arachnos, leaving our Lord in charge. And, over all the years he has been in power, Lord Recluse has never forgotten this. Remember that. Lord Recluse never forgets. And if you fail to mete out the punishment I decree for Ghost Widow, Lord Recluse will not forget that, either. <br><br>I have often thought our poor Ghost Widow might hold a hatred for Red Widow. A rivalry, of sorts, though the two have never met. They are both beautiful ghosts who still haunt Arachnos, though in different ways. Maybe it is jealousy that drove Ghost Widow to this? In the end, it doesn't matter. Just remember your part. Instead of helping return to life, you are to defeat her."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1285689041" "You return, my {VillainName}, and alive. That can only mean that Daos knows nothing. If he suspected anything, he surely would have had you... Dealt with. <br><br>Did that sound callous of me? It's difficult to tell. The dead often forget the perils of the living. It will be so strange to experience it all once more."
// RandomFameString :
"P2209966519" "I saw {VillainName} plotting with Arbiter Daos!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission6 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1449783722" "Whatever Arbiter Daos wanted from you, it need not delay my ceremony any longer. I will be flesh again, {VillainName}! I will walk these streets once more!"
// AcceptString :
"P1098953723" "Perform the ceremony"
// SendOffString :
"P2343147653" "You must go to the tunnels of Mu once more. There, you can enact the ritual that will make me mortal at last!"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3244513455" "Betray Ghost Widow"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1182869709" "I grow impatient, {VillainName}. Complete the ceremony at once!"

