// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3148347594" "Ghost Widow"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1980507108" "What has happened? Why am I not whole? Why am I not alive?"
// Script Variable BOSS_1STBLOOD_DIALOG :
"P4266825334" "You have betrayed me, {VillainName}, and you will die for it!"
// Script Variable BOSS_75HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P130606039" "I still cannot even feel pain! This is worse than death!"
// Script Variable BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P3188531734" "Betrayer! Deceiver! I will see you dead yet, and make your soul my slave!"
// Script Variable BOSS_25HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P3527583184" "I feel weaker! Can it be that you will defeat me?"
// Script Variable BOSS_DEAD_DIALOG :
